---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About — PapaGaio">
  <h1>About PapaGaio</h1>
  <p style="max-width: 640px;">
    Born out of frustration: three years of language schools, flashcard apps that
    paywall the useful parts, and translators that quietly teach Brazilian
    Portuguese to people living in Portugal.
  </p>

  <h2>What it does</h2>
  <ul class="muted" style="max-width: 640px; line-height: 1.9;">
    <li><strong style="color:var(--text)">AI voice coach</strong> — scenario roleplay (café, bank, doctor), speaks and listens, corrects gently.</li>
    <li><strong style="color:var(--text)">Translator with a pt-PT guarantee</strong> — flags every Brazilian divergence.</li>
    <li><strong style="color:var(--text)">A card every 15 minutes</strong> in Telegram during working hours. One tap. FSRS spaced repetition.</li>
    <li><strong style="color:var(--text)">Pronunciation checks</strong> — say the word, Whisper verifies what you actually said.</li>
    <li><strong style="color:var(--text)">Your phrases become cards</strong> — translate anything, one tap adds it to your deck with audio.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Anti-features</h2>
  <ul class="muted" style="max-width: 640px; line-height: 1.9;">
    <li>No subscriptions, no premium tier, no locked content. Ever.</li>
    <li>No streak shaming — ignore three cards and the bot politely goes quiet until tomorrow.</li>
    <li>No Brazilian Portuguese mixed in. pt-PT only, checked card by card.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Stack</h2>
  <p class="muted" style="max-width: 640px;">
    Cloudflare Workers + D1, Edge TTS, Groq Whisper, FSRS. Everything runs on
    free tiers. <a href="https://github.com/kirshp/papagaio">Source on GitHub</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>FAQ</h2>
  <div style="max-width:640px;">
    <p><strong>Is it really free?</strong><br />
    <span class="muted">Yes, entirely and permanently. The whole stack runs on free tiers; there is nothing to charge for and no premium tier planned. That's the founding principle, not a promo.</span></p>
    <p><strong>What exactly is pt-PT?</strong><br />
    <span class="muted">European Portuguese — the variant spoken in Portugal and Madeira. It differs from Brazilian in vocabulary (autocarro vs ônibus), grammar (estou a fazer vs estou fazendo) and pronunciation. Most apps teach Brazilian without telling you.</span></p>
    <p><strong>Why spaced repetition instead of lessons?</strong><br />
    <span class="muted">FSRS schedules each card for the moment you're about to forget it. Twenty seconds every 15 minutes beats an hour on Sunday — the math on forgetting curves is brutal and well studied.</span></p>
    <p><strong>Where do my voice messages go?</strong><br />
    <span class="muted">To Groq (US) for transcription, then they're discarded. Details in <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '')}/privacy/`}>privacy</a>.</span></p>
    <p><strong>Can I use it outside Telegram?</strong><br />
    <span class="muted">The translator and dictionary work right here. Mobile apps (Android/iOS) with offline decks and local notifications are on the roadmap.</span></p>
  </div>

  <p style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <a class="btn" href="https://t.me/papagaio_bot">Open the bot →</a>
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
